## 模板（Queries / Params）
> 下列為**可直接使用**的查詢模板；由規則決定**何時**使用。請依照「事件規則」觸發，而非每次會話都執行。

### Q0. Boot Check（讀；判斷是否需要初始化）
**Query**
```cypher
WITH $project AS pname
OPTIONAL MATCH (p:Project {name:pname})
WITH pname, p, coalesce(p.initializedAt,0) AS initializedAt
CALL { WITH 1 AS _
  SHOW CONSTRAINTS YIELD name
  WITH collect(name) AS names
  RETURN all(x IN ['project_name_unique','task_id_unique','file_path_unique','change_id_unique'] WHERE x IN names) AS haveUniques
}
CALL { WITH 1 AS _
  SHOW INDEXES YIELD name
  WITH collect(name) AS idxnames
  RETURN all(x IN ['task_status_idx','change_ts_idx','spec_kind_idx'] WHERE x IN idxnames) AS haveIndexes
}
OPTIONAL MATCH (p)-[:HAS_SPEC]->(s:Spec)
WITH pname, p, initializedAt, haveUniques, haveIndexes, count(s) AS specCount
RETURN {
  project: coalesce(p.name, pname),
  initializedAt: initializedAt,
  checks: {haveUniques:haveUniques, haveIndexes:haveIndexes, specCount:specCount},
  needInit: (p IS NULL) OR (NOT(haveUniques AND haveIndexes)) OR specCount=0 OR initializedAt=0
} AS boot;
```
**Params** `{"project":"Eternal Abyss"}`

---

### Q1. 初始化（有 APOC：一次跑完；執行前需使用者同意）
**Query**
```cypher
CALL apoc.cypher.runMany($cypher, {project:$project, specs:$specs})
```
**Params**
```json
{
  "project": "Eternal Abyss",
  "specs": [
    {"kind":"CONSTRAINTS","content":"禁止移除公共 API；類/結構/列舉 PascalCase；方法/欄位 camelCase；避免不必要單例；破壞性改動需有兼容層。"},
    {"kind":"STYLE","content":"C# 依 .editorconfig；Unity 一檔一類；非 MonoBehaviour 邏輯分離；單檔 ≤400 行；Tests 後綴。"},
    {"kind":"PROCESS","content":"每次修改：讀快照→5–10 行總結→最小 diff（Eternal Abyss 2/）→寫回 Change→（選）更新 Task。"}
  ],
  "cypher": "CREATE CONSTRAINT project_name_unique IF NOT EXISTS FOR (p:Project) REQUIRE p.name IS UNIQUE;\nCREATE CONSTRAINT task_id_unique IF NOT EXISTS FOR (t:Task) REQUIRE t.id IS UNIQUE;\nCREATE CONSTRAINT file_path_unique IF NOT EXISTS FOR (f:File) REQUIRE f.path IS UNIQUE;\nCREATE CONSTRAINT change_id_unique IF NOT EXISTS FOR (c:Change) REQUIRE c.id IS UNIQUE;\nCREATE INDEX task_status_idx IF NOT EXISTS FOR (t:Task) ON (t.status);\nCREATE INDEX change_ts_idx IF NOT EXISTS FOR (c:Change) ON (c.ts);\nCREATE INDEX spec_kind_idx IF NOT EXISTS FOR (s:Spec) ON (s.kind);\nMERGE (p:Project {name:$project})\nSET p.initializedAt = coalesce(p.initializedAt, timestamp()), p.mcpRulesVersion = 1\nWITH p, $specs AS specs\nUNWIND specs AS s\nMERGE (sp:Spec {kind:s.kind})\nSET sp.content = s.content, sp.updatedAt = timestamp()\nMERGE (p)-[:HAS_SPEC]->(sp);"
}
```
**無 APOC 時**：改為逐條執行（每次只送一條）建立約束/索引，接著寫入 Spec 並 `SET p.initializedAt`。

