### Q2. 讀「專案快照」（容錯）
**Query**
```cypher
WITH $project AS pname
OPTIONAL MATCH (p:Project {name:pname})
OPTIONAL MATCH (p)-[:HAS_SPEC]->(s:Spec)
WITH pname, p, collect(s{.kind,.content,.updatedAt}) AS specs
OPTIONAL MATCH (p)-[:HAS_TASK]->(t:Task)
WHERE p IS NOT NULL AND (coalesce($openOnly,true) = false OR t.status IN ['Open','InProgress'])
WITH pname, p, specs, collect(CASE WHEN t IS NULL THEN null ELSE t{.id,.status,.goal,.priority,.updatedAt} END) AS tasks_raw
WITH pname, p, specs, [x IN tasks_raw WHERE x IS NOT NULL] AS tasks
OPTIONAL MATCH (p)<-[:IN_PROJECT]-(c:Change)
WITH pname, p, specs, tasks, c
ORDER BY c.ts DESC
WITH pname, p, specs, tasks, collect(c{.id,.ts,.summary,.reason}) AS changes
RETURN {
  project: coalesce(p.name, pname),
  specs: specs,
  tasks: tasks,
  recentChanges: changes[0..10]
} AS snapshot;
```
**Params** `{"project":"Eternal Abyss","openOnly":true}`

---

### Q3. 記錄本次變更（Change）
**Query**
```cypher
MERGE (p:Project {name:$project})
MERGE (t:Task {id:$taskId})
MERGE (p)-[:HAS_TASK]->(t)
WITH p,t,$files AS paths,$summary AS summary,$reason AS reason,$diff AS diff,
     coalesce($author,'CodeBuddy') AS author, $model AS model
WITH p,t,paths,summary,reason,
     (CASE WHEN diff IS NULL OR size(diff)=0 THEN '<no-diff>' ELSE
           (CASE WHEN size(diff) > 100000 THEN substring(diff,0,100000) + '\n[TRUNCATED]' ELSE diff END) END) AS safeDiff,
     author, model
UNWIND paths AS filePath
MERGE (f:File {path:filePath})
MERGE (f)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(p)
WITH p,t,collect(f) AS files, summary, reason, safeDiff, author, model
WITH p,t,files, summary, reason, safeDiff, author, model, toString(randomUUID()) AS cid
CREATE (c:Change {id:cid, ts:timestamp(), summary:summary, reason:reason, diff:safeDiff, author:author, model:model})
MERGE (c)-[:IN_PROJECT]->(p)
MERGE (c)-[:FOR_TASK]->(t)
FOREACH(f IN files | MERGE (c)-[:MODIFIES]->(f))
RETURN c.id AS changeId, c.ts AS ts;
```
**Params（示例）**
```json
{
  "project":"Eternal Abyss",
  "taskId":"<現有子任務 id>",
  "files":["Eternal Abyss 2/Assets/Scripts/..."],
  "summary":"（一句話摘要）",
  "reason":"（依 Spec/設計書的理由）",
  "diff":"（unified diff 全文）",
  "author":"CodeBuddy",
  "model":"（實際模型名）"
}
```

---

### Q4. 更新任務狀態（選）
**Query**
```cypher
MATCH (t:Task {id:$taskId})
SET t.status=$status,
    t.progress=coalesce($progress, t.progress),
    t.updatedAt=timestamp()
RETURN t;
```
**Params（示例）** `{"taskId":"<id>","status":"InProgress"}` 或 `{"taskId":"<id>","status":"Done"}`

